---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "")}/`;
---

<section class="reference-status">
  <p class="panel-label">03 / Reference implementation</p>
  <h2>The existing world still runs.</h2>
  <p>
    This first reorganisation adds the specification and site boundaries
    without relocating the working runtime. The current PlayCanvas, GitHub,
    Hara, OPFS, Web Audio, authoring, publication, and Studio stack remains the
    reference implementation while adapters are extracted incrementally.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-links">
    <a class="action action--primary" href={`${base}demo/`}>Open demo <span>→</span></a>
    <a class="action" href={`${base}implementation/directory-map/`}>Directory map</a>
  </div>
</section>
